evidence = "The cold scheduler ABI introduced by commit 054988c9f53ec52ac1f21d54dfcdb58d6e0f9ffa still declares JobExecuted and JobFailed at precompiles/setup.go:239 and precompiles/setup.go:240, which GetPrecompileInfoE selects at precompiles/setup.go:554, while the served constructor parses only the three events at precompiles/layerxagent/scheduler/scheduler.go:32 through precompiles/layerxagent/scheduler/scheduler.go:35 via precompiles/layerxagent/scheduler/scheduler.go:53, contradicting the complete ABI equality assertion at precompiles/setup_test.go:425 despite task 22.6.4 being marked done by commit de036d25cef971e05feeffe567b2df0797a6937f."
close_comment = "Scheduler metadata before initialization still advertises JobExecuted and JobFailed, which are absent from the served contract ABI. A focused follow-up task will align the metadata with the served scheduler and preserve the complete ABI equality and initialization checks."

